%
(DMC2 SCRIPT 1)
(DMC2 EFFECTS axis-motion;digital-output;coordinate-state;external-command)
(DMC2 REQUIRES running-session;estop-clear;machine-on;interpreter-idle;all-homed)
(DMC2 RECOVERY abort-task)
(DMC2 END)
(Shallow top contact map. Start clear just above the chosen high reference point.)
(The reference plus clearance must clear everything along the selected XY region and entry path.)
(Physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X; physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X.)
(Measure reference, retract, scan rows with fast contact / release / slow re-touch.)
(Every XY transfer is at the same clearance plane. No progressive downward following.)
(A missing grid contact is unmeasured below the fixed search floor, never a fabricated height.)
(Ends at the last grid point at clearance. No work-offset or tool-offset writes.)
(Operator recovery uses Abort, Clear Fault and Pendant Mode. See ../../docs/surface-mapping.md.)

(Required region offsets from the starting XY in signed LinuxCNC mm; zero span is UNSET.)
(X offset positive = physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; negative = physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X.)
#<x_min_offset_mm> = 0
#<x_max_offset_mm> = 0
#<y_min_offset_mm> = 0
#<y_max_offset_mm> = 0
(Required grid spacing and mounted usable reach. Zero is UNSET.)
#<spacing_mm> = 0
(Usable reach is clearance from the ball bottom to the first interfering part over this region.)
(The nominal stylus drawing is not a measurement of the mounted clearance.)
#<usable_reach_mm> = 0
(PROPOSAL - NOT ACTUAL: shallow layer requested by operator, with a few mm reserve.)
#<max_drop_mm> = 3
#<reference_search_mm> = 3
#<clearance_mm> = 2
#<reach_reserve_mm> = 2
(SOURCE-VERIFIED feed range endpoints. No separately specified optimum was found.)
#<coarse_feed_mm_min> = 200
#<fine_feed_mm_min> = 50
#<ball_diameter_mm> = 2

o<sm_preview> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    (PREVIEW,stop)
    M2
o<sm_preview> endif
o<sm_region> if [[#<x_max_offset_mm> LE #<x_min_offset_mm>] OR [#<y_max_offset_mm> LE #<y_min_offset_mm>]]
    (ABORT,Surface region is unset or reversed. Set its signed X/Y extents, then File Open again. Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<sm_region> endif
o<sm_settings> if [[#<spacing_mm> LE 0] OR [#<usable_reach_mm> LE 0]]
    (ABORT,Set grid spacing and mounted usable probe reach, then File Open again. No motion was issued; Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<sm_settings> endif
o<sm_depth_positive> if [[#<max_drop_mm> LE 0] OR [#<reference_search_mm> LE 0] OR [#<clearance_mm> LE 0] OR [#<reach_reserve_mm> LE 0]]
    (ABORT,Search, drop, clearance and reach reserve must be positive. Review the settings and reopen the file; Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<sm_depth_positive> endif
#<reach_budget> = [#<usable_reach_mm> - #<reach_reserve_mm>]
o<sm_reach> if [[#<max_drop_mm> GT #<reach_budget>] OR [#<reference_search_mm> GT #<reach_budget>]]
    (ABORT,Requested descent exceeds mounted usable reach minus reserve. The script has not clipped the range. Review the settings and reopen; Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<sm_reach> endif
o<sm_feed> if [[#<fine_feed_mm_min> LT 50] OR [#<coarse_feed_mm_min> GT 200] OR [#<coarse_feed_mm_min> LE #<fine_feed_mm_min>]]
    (ABORT,Use increasing fine/coarse feeds within the published 50-200 mm/min range. Review settings and reopen; Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<sm_feed> endif
o<sm_spindle> if [#<_spindle_on> NE 0]
    (ABORT,Surface probing requires the spindle off. Use Spindle Stop and reopen the file; Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<sm_spindle> endif
M66 P3 L0
o<sm_spindle_report> if [#5399 NE 0]
    (ABORT,The spindle monitor reports running. Use Spindle Stop before surface probing; Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<sm_spindle_report> endif
o<sm_rotation> if [#[5230 + [#5220 - 1] * 20] NE 0]
    (ABORT,Surface mapping requires an unrotated work frame. Select that frame and reopen; no offsets have been changed.)
o<sm_rotation> endif

M70
G21 G90 G94 G17 G40 G80 G61.1
#<_sm_ox> = [#<_abs_x> - #<_x>]
#<_sm_oy> = [#<_abs_y> - #<_y>]
#<_sm_oz> = [#<_abs_z> - #<_z>]
#<_sm_start_x> = #<_x>
#<_sm_start_y> = #<_y>
#<_sm_start_z> = #<_z>
#<_sm_xmin> = [#<_x> + #<x_min_offset_mm>]
#<_sm_xmax> = [#<_x> + #<x_max_offset_mm>]
#<_sm_ymin> = [#<_y> + #<y_min_offset_mm>]
#<_sm_ymax> = [#<_y> + #<y_max_offset_mm>]
#<_sm_spacing> = #<spacing_mm>
#<_sm_coarse> = #<coarse_feed_mm_min>
#<_sm_fine> = #<fine_feed_mm_min>
(Half the configured Z command increment defines the clearance comparison cell.)
#<_sm_z_cell> = [0.5 / ABS[#<_ini[joint_2]scale>]]
#<_sm_nx> = FUP[[#<_sm_xmax> - #<_sm_xmin>] / #<_sm_spacing>]
#<_sm_ny> = FUP[[#<_sm_ymax> - #<_sm_ymin>] / #<_sm_spacing>]
#<columns> = [#<_sm_nx> + 1]
#<rows> = [#<_sm_ny> + 1]
#<points> = [#<columns> * #<rows>]
(Reserve two contact records per point, reference contacts, start and result in signed decimal sequence storage.)
o<sm_record_capacity> if [[2 * #<points> + 4] GT 2147483647]
    (ABORT,Grid exceeds capture sequence storage. Increase spacing or reduce the region and reopen; Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<sm_record_capacity> endif
#<bx> = [[[#<_sm_xmin> + #<_sm_ox>] LE #<_ini[axis_x]min_limit>] OR [[#<_sm_xmax> + #<_sm_ox>] GE #<_ini[axis_x]max_limit>]]
#<by> = [[[#<_sm_ymin> + #<_sm_oy>] LE #<_ini[axis_y]min_limit>] OR [[#<_sm_ymax> + #<_sm_oy>] GE #<_ini[axis_y]max_limit>]]
#<lowest> = [#<_sm_start_z> + #<_sm_oz> - #<reference_search_mm> - #<max_drop_mm>]
#<highest> = [#<_sm_start_z> + #<_sm_oz> + #<clearance_mm>]
o<sm_bounds> if [#<bx> OR #<by> OR [#<lowest> LE #<_ini[axis_z]min_limit>] OR [#<highest> GE #<_ini[axis_z]max_limit>]]
    (ABORT,The region or possible reference/drop/clearance envelope reaches a configured travel boundary. Review settings and reopen; no range was clipped. Pendant Mode remains available.)
o<sm_bounds> endif
#<_sm_sequence> = 0
#<_sm_point> = -1
#<_sm_row> = -1
#<_sm_column> = -1
#<_sm_hits> = 0
#<_sm_misses> = 0
(P1 selects the already-wired XYZ probe IN1; it does not power the probe.)
M64 P1
M66 P5 L0
o<sm_select> if [#5399 NE 1]
    (ABORT,XYZ probe selection was not reported. Abort then Pendant Mode; review the IN1 selection indication before rerunning.)
o<sm_select> endif
o<sm_start_contact> if [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
    (ABORT,The probe is already touching. Abort then use Pendant Mode to place it clear above the high reference point.)
o<sm_start_contact> endif
M190 P2 Q0
M66 P5 L0
(LOGOPEN,../tmp/output/surface-request.txt)
(LOG,DMC2_SURFACE_RECORD_V1)
(LOG,sequence=%d#<_sm_sequence>)
(LOG,kind=start)
(LOG,x=%.9f#<_sm_start_x>)
(LOG,y=%.9f#<_sm_start_y>)
(LOG,z=%.9f#<_sm_start_z>)
(LOG,offset_x=%.9f#<_sm_ox>)
(LOG,offset_y=%.9f#<_sm_oy>)
(LOG,offset_z=%.9f#<_sm_oz>)
(LOG,x_min=%.9f#<_sm_xmin>)
(LOG,x_max=%.9f#<_sm_xmax>)
(LOG,y_min=%.9f#<_sm_ymin>)
(LOG,y_max=%.9f#<_sm_ymax>)
(LOG,spacing=%.9f#<_sm_spacing>)
(LOG,columns=%d#<columns>)
(LOG,rows=%d#<rows>)
(LOG,reference_search=%.9f#<reference_search_mm>)
(LOG,max_drop=%.9f#<max_drop_mm>)
(LOG,clearance=%.9f#<clearance_mm>)
(LOG,usable_reach=%.9f#<usable_reach_mm>)
(LOG,reach_reserve=%.9f#<reach_reserve_mm>)
(LOG,feed=%.9f#<_sm_fine>)
(LOG,coarse_feed=%.9f#<_sm_coarse>)
(LOG,ball_diameter=%.9f#<ball_diameter_mm>)
(LOGCLOSE)
o<sm_save> call

(Reference at current XY: physical Z down / LinuxCNC -Z.)
#<_sm_floor> = [#<_sm_start_z> - #<reference_search_mm>]
o<sm_seek> call [#<_sm_coarse>] [0]
o<sm_reference_missing> if [#<_sm_hit> NE 1]
    (ABORT,CAPTURE FAILED - KEEP THE SETUP IN PLACE. No high-reference contact within the configured search. Abort then Pendant Mode; no return was issued.)
o<sm_reference_missing> endif
o<sm_release> call [#<_sm_start_z>]
o<sm_seek> call [#<_sm_fine>] [1]
o<sm_reference_fine_missing> if [#<_sm_hit> NE 1]
    (ABORT,CAPTURE FAILED - KEEP THE SETUP IN PLACE. The reference slow re-touch failed. Abort then Pendant Mode; coarse data is not used as a surface height.)
o<sm_reference_fine_missing> endif
#<_sm_reference> = #<_sm_tz>
#<_sm_clear> = [#<_sm_reference> + #<clearance_mm>]
#<_sm_floor> = [#<_sm_reference> - #<max_drop_mm>]
o<sm_retract> call

#<_sm_point> = 0
#<_sm_row> = 0
o<sm_rows> while [#<_sm_row> LE #<_sm_ny>]
    #<target_y> = [#<_sm_ymin> + #<_sm_row> * #<_sm_spacing>]
    o<sm_last_y> if [#<_sm_row> EQ #<_sm_ny>]
        #<target_y> = #<_sm_ymax>
    o<sm_last_y> endif
    #<walk> = 0
    o<sm_columns> while [#<walk> LE #<_sm_nx>]
        #<_sm_column> = #<walk>
        o<sm_reverse_row> if [[#<_sm_row> MOD 2] EQ 1]
            #<_sm_column> = [#<_sm_nx> - #<walk>]
        o<sm_reverse_row> endif
        #<target_x> = [#<_sm_xmin> + #<_sm_column> * #<_sm_spacing>]
        o<sm_last_x> if [#<_sm_column> EQ #<_sm_nx>]
            #<target_x> = #<_sm_xmax>
        o<sm_last_x> endif
        (Even rows increase X: physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; odd rows decrease: physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X.)
        (Entry X also follows increasing = physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; decreasing = physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X.)
        o<sm_move> call [#<target_x>] [#<target_y>] [#<_sm_clear>]
        o<sm_seek> call [#<_sm_coarse>] [0]
        o<sm_point_contact> if [#<_sm_hit> EQ 1]
            o<sm_release> call [#<_sm_clear>]
            o<sm_seek> call [#<_sm_fine>] [1]
            o<sm_point_fine_missing> if [#<_sm_hit> NE 1]
                (ABORT,CAPTURE FAILED - KEEP THE SETUP IN PLACE. Coarse contact was found but slow re-touch failed. Abort then Pendant Mode; this point has no accepted height.)
            o<sm_point_fine_missing> endif
            #<_sm_hits> = [#<_sm_hits> + 1]
        o<sm_point_contact> else
            o<sm_miss_record> call
            #<_sm_misses> = [#<_sm_misses> + 1]
        o<sm_point_contact> endif
        o<sm_retract> call
        #<_sm_point> = [#<_sm_point> + 1]
        #<walk> = [#<walk> + 1]
    o<sm_columns> endwhile
    (Next row increases LinuxCNC Y; all lateral travel remains at the reference clearance plane.)
    #<_sm_row> = [#<_sm_row> + 1]
o<sm_rows> endwhile

M65 P1
M66 P5 L0
o<sm_selection_release> if [#5399 NE 0]
    (ABORT,Grid ended but program probe selection did not clear. Use Abort then Pendant Mode; captures remain in tmp/output/surface.)
o<sm_selection_release> endif
(LOGOPEN,../tmp/output/surface-request.txt)
(LOG,DMC2_SURFACE_RECORD_V1)
(LOG,sequence=%d#<_sm_sequence>)
(LOG,kind=result)
(LOG,points=%d#<_sm_point>)
(LOG,hits=%d#<_sm_hits>)
(LOG,misses=%d#<_sm_misses>)
(LOG,reference_work_z=%.9f#<_sm_reference>)
(LOG,clearance_work_z=%.9f#<_sm_clear>)
(LOG,floor_work_z=%.9f#<_sm_floor>)
(LOG,final_work_x=%.9f#<_x>)
(LOG,final_work_y=%.9f#<_y>)
(LOG,final_work_z=%.9f#<_z>)
(LOGCLOSE)
o<sm_save> call
(DEBUG,Surface records: %d#<_sm_hits> measured, %d#<_sm_misses> unmeasured. Ledger, CSV and metadata in tmp/output/surface.)
M72
M2

o<sm_save> sub
    M190 P3 Q#<_sm_sequence>
    M66 P5 L0
    #<_sm_sequence> = [#<_sm_sequence> + 1]
o<sm_save> endsub

o<sm_seek> sub
    (Arguments: commanded feed, stage 0 coarse or 1 fine. Physical DOWN / LinuxCNC -Z.)
    o<sm_seek_active> if [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
        (ABORT,Probe remains active before a downward touch. Abort then Pendant Mode; no new probe move was issued.)
    o<sm_seek_active> endif
    G38.3 Z#<_sm_floor> F#1
    #<_sm_hit> = #5070
    o<sm_seek_hit> if [#<_sm_hit> EQ 1]
        #<_sm_tx> = #5061
        #<_sm_ty> = #5062
        #<_sm_tz> = #5063
        #<mx> = [#<_sm_tx> + #<_sm_ox>]
        #<my> = [#<_sm_ty> + #<_sm_oy>]
        #<mz> = [#<_sm_tz> + #<_sm_oz>]
        (LOGOPEN,../tmp/output/surface-request.txt)
        (LOG,DMC2_SURFACE_RECORD_V1)
        (LOG,sequence=%d#<_sm_sequence>)
        (LOG,kind=touch)
        (LOG,point=%d#<_sm_point>)
        (LOG,row=%d#<_sm_row>)
        (LOG,column=%d#<_sm_column>)
        (LOG,stage=%d#2)
        (LOG,axis=2)
        (LOG,direction=-1)
        (LOG,success=%d#5070)
        (LOG,work_x=%.9f#<_sm_tx>)
        (LOG,work_y=%.9f#<_sm_ty>)
        (LOG,work_z=%.9f#<_sm_tz>)
        (LOG,machine_x=%.9f#<mx>)
        (LOG,machine_y=%.9f#<my>)
        (LOG,machine_z=%.9f#<mz>)
        (LOG,feed=%.9f#1)
        (LOGCLOSE)
        o<sm_save> call
        (DEBUG,Surface point %d#<_sm_point> stage %d#2: machine trigger %.9f#<mx>,#<my>,#<mz> mm; saved and read back)
    o<sm_seek_hit> endif
o<sm_seek> endsub

o<sm_release> sub
    (Physical UP / LinuxCNC +Z; stop on release before a slow re-touch or full retract.)
    o<sm_release_needed> if [#<_hal[motion.probe-input]> NE 0]
        G38.5 Z#1 F#<_sm_fine>
        o<sm_release_failed> if [#5070 NE 1]
            (ABORT,Probe did not release before its clear return height. Captures are retained. Abort then Pendant Mode; no sideways move was issued.)
        o<sm_release_failed> endif
    o<sm_release_needed> endif
o<sm_release> endsub

o<sm_retract> sub
    o<sm_release> call [#<_sm_clear>]
    (Retract physical UP / LinuxCNC +Z; X and Y remain unchanged.)
    (No X change; if numerical X increases = physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X, decreases = physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X.)
    o<sm_move> call [#<_x>] [#<_y>] [#<_sm_clear>]
o<sm_retract> endsub

o<sm_move> sub
    (Arguments: work X,Y,Z; use only after release, always transfer XY at the common clearance.)
    #<from_x> = #<_x>
    #<from_y> = #<_y>
    #<from_z> = #<_z>
    #<z_clear> = [[ABS[#<from_z> - #<_sm_clear>] LE #<_sm_z_cell>] AND [#3 EQ #<_sm_clear>]]
    o<sm_transfer_height> if [[[#1 NE #<from_x>] OR [#2 NE #<from_y>]] AND [#<z_clear> EQ 0]]
        (ABORT,XY transfer was requested below the reference clearance plane. Abort then Pendant Mode; no sideways move was issued.)
    o<sm_transfer_height> endif
    o<sm_move_needed> if [[#1 NE #<from_x>] OR [#2 NE #<from_y>] OR [#3 NE #<from_z>]]
        (X increasing = physical LEFT / LinuxCNC +X; X decreasing = physical RIGHT / LinuxCNC -X.)
        G38.3 X#1 Y#2 Z#3 F#<_sm_coarse>
        o<sm_obstructed> if [#5070 NE 0]
            o<sm_obstruction_record> call [#<from_x>] [#<from_y>] [#<from_z>] [#1] [#2] [#3]
            (ABORT,Unexpected contact during a clearance transfer. KEEP THE SETUP IN PLACE. Obstruction trigger is retained; Abort then Pendant Mode. This is not a surface sample.)
        o<sm_obstructed> endif
    o<sm_move_needed> endif
o<sm_move> endsub

o<sm_miss_record> sub
    #<mx> = [#<_x> + #<_sm_ox>]
    #<my> = [#<_y> + #<_sm_oy>]
    #<mz> = [#<_sm_floor> + #<_sm_oz>]
    (LOGOPEN,../tmp/output/surface-request.txt)
    (LOG,DMC2_SURFACE_RECORD_V1)
    (LOG,sequence=%d#<_sm_sequence>)
    (LOG,kind=miss)
    (LOG,point=%d#<_sm_point>)
    (LOG,row=%d#<_sm_row>)
    (LOG,column=%d#<_sm_column>)
    (LOG,work_x=%.9f#<_x>)
    (LOG,work_y=%.9f#<_y>)
    (LOG,floor_work_z=%.9f#<_sm_floor>)
    (LOG,machine_x=%.9f#<mx>)
    (LOG,machine_y=%.9f#<my>)
    (LOG,floor_machine_z=%.9f#<mz>)
    (LOG,feed=%.9f#<_sm_coarse>)
    (LOGCLOSE)
    o<sm_save> call
o<sm_miss_record> endsub

o<sm_obstruction_record> sub
    #<wx> = #5061
    #<wy> = #5062
    #<wz> = #5063
    #<mx> = [#<wx> + #<_sm_ox>]
    #<my> = [#<wy> + #<_sm_oy>]
    #<mz> = [#<wz> + #<_sm_oz>]
    (LOGOPEN,../tmp/output/surface-request.txt)
    (LOG,DMC2_SURFACE_RECORD_V1)
    (LOG,sequence=%d#<_sm_sequence>)
    (LOG,kind=obstruction)
    (LOG,success=%d#5070)
    (LOG,work_x=%.9f#<wx>)
    (LOG,work_y=%.9f#<wy>)
    (LOG,work_z=%.9f#<wz>)
    (LOG,machine_x=%.9f#<mx>)
    (LOG,machine_y=%.9f#<my>)
    (LOG,machine_z=%.9f#<mz>)
    (LOG,from_x=%.9f#1)
    (LOG,from_y=%.9f#2)
    (LOG,from_z=%.9f#3)
    (LOG,target_x=%.9f#4)
    (LOG,target_y=%.9f#5)
    (LOG,target_z=%.9f#6)
    (LOG,feed=%.9f#<_sm_coarse>)
    (LOGCLOSE)
    o<sm_save> call
o<sm_obstruction_record> endsub
%
